error: a borrowed `Session` cannot be taken apart
  --> borrowed-scrutinee.norn:13:11
   |
13 |     match session {
   |           ^^^^^^^ a `match` through `&` binds copies
   = note: a `Session` reaches a resource, and a resource has one owner — a binding here would be a second
   = note: match the owned value instead: drop the `&`, or take the parameter by value

